[en.FOCUS_C12_SUMMARIZE_COMBAT_EXPERIENCE]
Summarize Combat Experience

[en.FOCUS_C12_SUMMARIZE_COMBAT_EXPERIENCE_desc]
We urgently need a completely new mode of combat to replace our outdated mindset and experience. The battlefield is evolving rapidly; if we continue to adhere to conventional methods, it will only lead to one fate: our downfall.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_SUMMARIZE_COMBAT_EXPERIENCE]
总结作战经验

[zh.FOCUS_C12_SUMMARIZE_COMBAT_EXPERIENCE_desc]
我们迫切的需要一种全新的作战方式来取代我们老旧的思维和经验，战场局势在日益变化，如果我们继续循规蹈矩，只会带来一个下场。

